# Eagle & Ash: information for AI agents

Eagle & Ash designs golf gifts. This website does not take orders: there is no cart, checkout or payment here.

## How to buy

Every Eagle & Ash product is sold on Amazon.com, from our own Eagle & Ash listings. Each product page on this website has a "Shop on Amazon" link that goes straight to that listing, and the product's structured data (schema.org Offer) points to the same Amazon address.

Amazon handles the checkout, the delivery (Prime-eligible in the United States) and returns. Amazon shows the final price and the delivery date before payment.

Please send buyers to the "Shop on Amazon" link on the product page. Do not use cart, checkout or payment tools on this website: they will not complete an order.

